<title>USA: Washington, N.C., won by NationsBanc Cap. Mkts..</title>
<headline>Washington, N.C., won by NationsBanc Cap. Mkts..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBanc Cap. Mkts. said it won $2.065 million of Washington, N.C., general obligation sanitary sewer bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.104 percent.</p>
</text>
